#: fdafde46694042b9ab115cbd97a5af28
msgid "RC input is configured for GHST by default on the TX1 (UART1_TX) pin using half-duplex. To support other RC protocols set SERIAL1_OPTIONS to 0. This will support all serial RC protocols except SBUS."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-OrqaF405.rst:72
#: 6f63d063fd664fada75b517f32046b16
msgid "FPort requires connection to the TX of the UART and ``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` be set to \"7\"."
